      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "An association has been established between lipid metabolism, clinical course and immediate prognosis of unstable angina. It has been shown that the low level of the main protein of high density lipoproteins Apo-I in unstable stenocardia is prognostically unfavourable criterion for the development of acute myocardial infarction."},
